    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2f92f16d79593ba05cbb158e0d0fcdc7.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>A <strong>magical vine fairy</strong> wakes you up to save the corrupted Garden Lands, but in order to grant you its powers, it needs to <strong>tangle with you</strong>! Now you can neither get too far away nor get too close to your partner.<br><br><strong>Cooperate and survive intense 10-minute runs</strong> filled with chaotic hazards, adversaries, and bosses while tied to your <i>&quot;berry&quot;</i> good friend in this fresh new twist on the <strong>bullet-heaven/horde-survival roguelite genre</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/af1c7f458e16c035d0ab6d530dc3b9a5.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/af1c7f458e16c035d0ab6d530dc3b9a5.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/af1c7f458e16c035d0ab6d530dc3b9a5.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2e1e87322c946d014b3eaf413965a0cd.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>The magical vine allows you to share weapons with <strong>&quot;ping-pong&quot; cooldown flowers</strong> that zip back and forth along the vine between you! <strong>Align, position, and time</strong> your attacks as the flower reaches you to effectively strike your foes!<br><br>Brandish weapons like the <strong>Banana Sword</strong> to slash towards your friend's opposite direction, or surround enemies and zap them casting the magic of the <strong>Strawberry Rod</strong>! Each weapon will require different strategies, and every attack adapts to the performer's build, allowing both players to customize the same weapons to their preffered upgrades and flavors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/ffe806f6b2a802268dbb7d6be6031d80.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>Craft powerful and unique builds with limitless combos and synergies, like unleashing multiple inflated <strong>Pumpkin Bombs</strong> causing massive <strong>Frosty Mayo explosions</strong>, or evolving your <strong>Strawberry Rod</strong> into a crit-hit monster engulfing enemies in <strong>Spicy Sauce flames</strong>!<br><br><strong>Expand</strong> your arsenal by collecting <strong>golden seeds</strong> to unlock new weapons, items, sauces, and characters, all of which you can <strong>upgrade ranks</strong> to increase their powers between runs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/18db3f8a63da3be244387abc4e9a02ea.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/18db3f8a63da3be244387abc4e9a02ea.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/18db3f8a63da3be244387abc4e9a02ea.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/09cafac37af119f72522d21dbe2e5f09.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br><strong>True cooperation</strong> is what sets Vinebound apart. Not only are attacks influenced by your partner, but you must also work together to open treasures faster, strategically pick drops, combine builds and <strong>revive each other</strong> amidst overwhelming odds. It's about <strong>cultivating your synergy</strong>, even if it requires chaotic communication and a few screams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/55f3c0e7300d9970fa4139a1db36df65.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/55f3c0e7300d9970fa4139a1db36df65.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/55f3c0e7300d9970fa4139a1db36df65.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/57b2a50c8f4fca795fa306a21d07c347.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>When playing solo, the vine fairy takes over the other end of the vine, <strong>echoing your basic movements</strong> but still able to move fast and independently as an <strong>aim</strong>. It\u2019s immune to damage, can collect drops, and has its own upgrades, allowing you to strategize combos for more than one character. Experience the full potential of the <strong>vine gameplay without overwhelming</strong> yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/4901bb0f2b37930563ef1de686fa9c28.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/4901bb0f2b37930563ef1de686fa9c28.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/4901bb0f2b37930563ef1de686fa9c28.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/a3c9ff007727cd05059b937b37a8391f.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>Survive scenarios like <strong>entangling forests, slippery ice floors, and shifting lava walls</strong>, each with special conditions such as getting frozen and needing to be dragged by your partner, all while facing moldy elite enemies carrying <strong>shiny treasures and formidable bosses</strong>. Complete the game for the first time to unlock the <strong>Spicy Mode</strong> and challenge yourself with tougher settings using your enhanced arsenal and skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/a2bf6eb41b2fbb79a9dc33ba0c62c7a2.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/a2bf6eb41b2fbb79a9dc33ba0c62c7a2.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/a2bf6eb41b2fbb79a9dc33ba0c62c7a2.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/d001766f8f9c4969f9d07f1c872b216e.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intense 10-minute runs</strong> that test your skills and cooperation.<br></li><li><strong>Innovative ping-pong cooldown</strong> system for your weapon attacks.<br></li><li><strong>True cooperative</strong> gameplay that requires synergy.<br></li><li>Single-player mode that still feels like a <strong>fresh take</strong>.<br></li><li>Powerful <strong>build combinations</strong> with weapons, items, characters, and sauces.<br></li><li>Challenging stages with unique mechanics from <strong>hazards, elite enemies and bosses</strong>.<br></li><li>Cards and characters to be <strong>unlocked and improved</strong> between your runs.<br></li><li>Post-game content: <strong>Spicy Mode</strong>, with tougher settings for those who want an extra challenge.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/c0cd42075a49da1dc82b333580c8c861.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/c0cd42075a49da1dc82b333580c8c861.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/c0cd42075a49da1dc82b333580c8c861.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
