e <strong>Strawberry Rod</strong>! Each weapon will require different strategies, and every attack adapts to the performer's build, allowing both players to customize the same weapons to their preffered upgrades and flavors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/2cea358de11cd74d79a4cf241472bba0.mp4?t=1749082164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/ffe806f6b2a802268dbb7d6be6031d80.avif?t=1749082164\" /></span><br>Craft powerful and unique builds with limitless combos and synergies, like unleashing multiple inflated <strong>Pumpkin Bombs</strong> causing massive <strong>Frosty Mayo explosions</strong>, or evolving your <strong>Strawberry Rod</strong> into a crit-hit monster engulfing enemies in <strong>Spicy Sauce flames</strong>!<br><br><strong>Expand</strong> your arsenal by collecting <strong>golden seeds</strong> to unlock new weapons, items, sauces, and characters, all of which you can <strong>upgrade ranks</strong> to increase their powers between runs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/18db3f8a63da3be244387abc4e9a02ea.poster.avif?t=1749082164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410030/extras/18db3f8a63da3be244387abc4e9a02ea.webm?t=1749082164\" type=\"video